  "description": "Desperate for quick cash, Wu-jeong Cheon takes a high-paying temporary gig aboard a luxury cruise ship. When high-profile passenger Sa Gong-Jun offers to hire him on the spot for a personal job, Wu-Jeong thinks his financial troubles are solved. But a fatal misunderstanding reveals Gong-Jun’s true intention: he wasn’t looking for a translator, but complete, humiliating physical submission. Trapped at sea with a ruthless man who demands his total surrender, Wu-Jeong’s life quickly veers into uncharted waters. As coercion blurs the line between resentment and desire, he finds himself ensnared in a dangerous bittersweet addiction.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
